            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu andaaonera mbazi atu a chivyazi cha Jakobo na aatsambule tsona akale atue. Andaauyiza edze asagale kpwenye tsi yao na ajeni andakpwedza agbwirane nao asagale phamwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu anjina anji andaaterya Aiziraeli kuuya kpwenye tsi yao ariyowewa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu. Hinyo Aiziraeli andaamiliki atu hano alume kpwa achetu akale atumwa ao. Andaahala mateka atu ambao kala akaateka na andatawala atu ambao kala anaaonera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya sonono, tabu yenu na kuhendeswa kazi za shokowa, Mwenyezi Mlungu andakpwedza akuphozeni marenda. Ndiphohenda hivyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwimwi mundaimba wira huno wa kumnyetera mfalume wa Babeli uambao,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
